  "note": "The hypothesis V³ < n makes the listed case 'all p_i ≤ V' vacuous; the formula (12 − 6k) holds without it. Erratum: For square-free n = p₁p₂p₃ > V³, F_{3,V}(n) = (12 − 6k)·log p₁ log p₂ log p₃ with k = #{i : p_i > V}, so it is 6·log p₁ log p₂ log p₃ when p₁ < p₂ ≤ V < p₃ and 0 when p₁ ≤ V < p₂ < p₃; the book prints these two values swapped (e.g. (checked by `scripts/checks/eq_3_16.py`)."
